cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Bayesian Changepoint Detection: A PyTorch Implementation"
abstract: "Bayesian online (Adams & MacKay 2007) and offline (Fearnhead 2006) changepoint detection with PyTorch: conjugate Normal-Gamma, Normal-Wishart, Normal (known variance) and Gamma-Poisson likelihoods, a streaming detector with bounded memory, the MAP segmentation, and per-segment statistics. Checked against scipy and exact enumeration, and against published results on the Turing Change Point Dataset."
authors:
